_config.json`: hash and memory configuration\n  * `source_adaptor_best.pt`: source-side adaptor checkpoint used with the source memory\n\n\n##   ⟨41⟩ Intended use \nThis artifact is meant to be paired with target-side adaptors from the XMemTransfer project for cross-model memory-transfer experiments.\n##   ⟨42⟩ Provenance \n  * source model family: LLaMA-2 7B\n  * source corpus: WikiText-2021\n  * source token budget: 15M\n\nDownloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨44⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨45⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨46⟩\n##  Collection including OLAResearchX/xmemtransfer-llama2-source-15m\n#### XMemTransfer Collection 20 items • Updated 16 days ago ⟨47⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨48⟩ Privacy⟨49⟩ About⟨50⟩ Careers⟨51⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
